# PHASE 1 — Environment template
# Create placeholder entries for APP_ENV, API_HOST, API_PORT, DATABASE_URL,
# and API_BASE_URL (used by Streamlit). Use a clearly fake PostgreSQL URL.
# Include optional OPENAI_API_KEY, LANGSMITH_API_KEY, LANGSMITH_TRACING and
# LANGSMITH_PROJECT as empty/disabled placeholders. Never add real keys here.
